<!--
  App.vue — Root component

  This is the top-level component mounted on #app. It imports the global
  stylesheets and renders the current route via <router-view />.

  Stylesheet load order matters:
    1. Bootstrap SCSS   — base framework styles
    2. Bootstrap Icons  — icon font for <VibeIcon> components
    3. VibeUI           — component library styles
    4. Quill            — WYSIWYG editor styles (used by VibeFormWysiwyg)
-->
